# Rendered preview output. `ruby _tests/preview.rb out` writes the four built
# pages here to look at in a browser; they are generated from the CSV and the
# YAML every time, so committing them would ship a stale copy of the real
# source alongside it.
#
# This lives in canada-strong/ rather than the repo root on purpose: the folder
# is meant to be copied out and worked on as a unit (see "This folder stands
# alone" in how-this-wizard-works.md), so the ignore travels with it.
#
# preview.rb takes the directory as an argument and only defaults to `out`, so
# if you render somewhere else, add it here too.
out/
